{
  "dom_id": "step-e10302",
  "name": "Example: Calculating a Conditional Variance Given a Conditional Mass Function",
  "problem": "| $y$ | $1$ | $2$ | $4$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $f_{Y|X}(y \\,|\\, 3)$ | $\\dfrac{1}{3}$ | $\\dfrac{1}{6}$ | $\\dfrac{1}{2}$ |\n\nSuppose $X$ and $Y$ are discrete random variables. Find $\\textrm{Var}\\big[Y \\,|\\, X=3\\big]$ given that the conditional probability mass function $f_{Y|X}(y \\,|\\, 3)$ is shown in the table above and the corresponding conditional expected value is $\\mu_{Y|3} = \\dfrac{8}{3}.$",
  "worked_solution": "Recall that the conditional variance of $Y$ given $X=x$ is defined by\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Var}[Y\\,|\\,X=x] & =\\text{E}[(Y-{\\mu }_{Y|x})^{2}\\,|\\,X=x] \\\\  & =\\text{E}[{Y}^{2}\\,|\\,X=x]-{\\mu }_{Y|x}^{2} \\\\  & =[{\\sum }_{y}{y}^{2}\\,{f}_{Y|X}(y\\,|\\,x)]-{\\mu }_{Y|x}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Var}[Y\\,|\\,X=3] & =[{\\sum }_{y}{y}^{2}\\,{f}_{Y|X}(y\\,|\\,3)]-{\\mu }_{Y|3}^{2} \\\\  & =[(1)^{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{3}+(2)^{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{6}+(4)^{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}]-{(\\frac{8}{3})}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}+\\frac{2}{3}+8-\\frac{64}{9} \\\\  & =\\frac{17}{9}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-e10302\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block;\">\n    \n                 \n                <div class=\"example\">\n                    <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                        <div class=\"stepName\"><span class=\"stepType\">Example:</span> Calculating a Conditional Variance Given a Conditional Mass Function</div>       \n                        <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"e10302\">?</div>\n                    </div>\n            \n                    <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                        <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage